;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ROBINRTP.MAC -- room type descriptors.
;
; Ported verbatim from the ZX original, $7B39-$8431.  Labels keep the original
; addresses: L<hex address>.
;
; 39. entries, room types $00-$26, one per type.  Each entry is a count byte
; followed by that many 2-byte tokens.  Entries are variable length and packed
; sequentially with no fixed stride, so reaching entry N means walking forward
; from L7B39 summing 2*count+1 for each preceding entry -- what the ZX routine
; at $C1C1 does, given a target index.
;
; Each token is a coordinate byte plus a block number:
;   coordinate  bits 0-2  X, in units of 4 character cells (columns 0,4,...,28)
;               bits 3-7  Y, character row 0-17.
;   block       index into the block table at L5B00; bit 7 selects horizontal
;               mirroring for that placement
;
; A room is drawn as its room-type tokens, then -- for room numbers below $0100
; -- the additional-element tokens on top.
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------

